     "target": "RAG_HETERODIMER",
     "interaction": "sensing",
     "effect": "activates",
     "mechanism": "Glucose sufficiency is relayed to mTORC1 through the Rag GTPases largely independently of AMPK (constitutively active RagA mice lose glucose sensing); glycolytic DHAP has been proposed as the sensed metabolite.",
