     "mechanism": "Falling O2 tension limits the prolyl-hydroxylase reaction, inactivating PHD2 and allowing HIF-1α to escape hydroxylation and degradation; this is the molecular basis of the HIF-1α stabilisation that drives REDD1 and BNIP3 induction.",
