     "effect": "inhibits",
     "mechanism": "In TSC, biallelic loss of a direct mTORC1 restraint makes the lesion fully mTORC1-dependent: roughly 35% achieved SEGA volume reduction, 42% angiomyolipoma reduction and 30-40% seizure reduction.",
