     "source": "RAPAMYCIN",
     "target": "MTORC2",
     "interaction": "drug_inhibition",
     "effect": "inhibits",
     "mechanism": "Chronic dosing lowers mTORC2 output, including AKT Ser473, in many but not all cell types, by blocking assembly of new complexes; selectivity for mTORC1 is therefore kinetic rather than absolute.",
