     "target": "PHENO_HYPERGLYCAEMIA",
     "interaction": "physiological_output",
     "effect": "activates",
     "mechanism": "Complete inhibition of both complexes adds mTORC2-dependent hyperglycaemia and insulin resistance to the rapalog toxicity profile, which is the toxicity ceiling that limited this generation.",
