     "mechanism": "The TSC1–TSC2–TBC1D7 complex (2:2:1) presents the TSC2 GAP domain at its apex to lysosomal Rheb and accelerates GTP hydrolysis ~100-fold; in the absence of insulin the complex is held on the lysosome through Rheb and is released when AKT phosphorylates TSC2.",
