     "interaction": "degradation",
     "effect": "inhibits",
     "mechanism": "mTOR phosphorylates DEPTOR at Ser293 and Ser299 (and Thr295), priming CK1alpha to phosphorylate the Ser286/Ser287/Ser291 degron, which SCF(beta-TrCP) binds, polyubiquitinates and sends for proteasomal degradation. Active mTOR thereby removes its own inhibitor in a positive-feedback loop.",
     "evidence": "established",
     "sites": [
