     "target": "AKT",
     "interaction": "scaffolding",
     "effect": "required_for",
     "mechanism": "An acidic loop of the mSin1 CRIM domain engages the basic AKT N-lobe surface ~75 Å from the catalytic site, encoding substrate choice by distal docking rather than local sequence.",
