     "target": "MAPKAPK2",
     "interaction": "translational_regulation",
     "effect": "activates",
     "mechanism": "mTOR promotes 4E-BP1-dependent translation of MAPKAPK2 (MK2) in senescent cells; MK2 phosphorylates the RNA-binding protein ZFP36L1 and blocks its degradation of SASP transcripts, sustaining the secretory phenotype.",
