     "target": "PHENO_SPINE_DENSITY",
     "interaction": "physiological_output",
     "effect": "inhibits",
     "mechanism": "Microglia-restricted Tsc1 deletion reduces synapse density alongside an amoeboid, highly proliferative and phagocytic microglial phenotype; the effect of pathway hyperactivation on synapses is therefore not cell-autonomous to neurons.",
