     "target": "PHENO_TREG_EXPANSION",
     "interaction": "physiological_output",
     "effect": "modulates",
     "mechanism": "In naive mouse CD4 cells without exogenous TGF-beta, combined inhibition of mTORC1 and mTORC2 promotes Foxp3 induction while inhibition of either complex alone is insufficient; established regulatory T cells conversely require mTORC1 for their metabolic programme and suppressive function.",
