   {
    "data": {
     "source": "MTORC2",
     "target": "TIAM1",
     "interaction": "physiological_output",
     "effect": "activates",
     "mechanism": "Forebrain mTORC2 promotes Rac1 activation through Tiam1 and the resulting actin polymerisation in dendritic spines, rather than acting through translational control; conditional Rictor deletion in postnatal forebrain selectively impairs late-phase LTP and long-term memory while sparing early-phase LTP and short-term memory.",
