     "interaction": "binding",
     "effect": "required_for",
     "mechanism": "Raptor binds the C-terminal TOS motif of 4E-BP1 and, according to NMR data, the N-terminal RAIP motif at a separate site, tethering 4E-BP1 so that its phosphoacceptor region is presented to the mTOR active site.",
