     "mechanism": "Phosphorylation of the S6K1 hydrophobic motif at Thr389 by mTORC1 creates a docking site for the PIF pocket of PDK1, which then phosphorylates the S6K1 activation loop at Thr229. The mTORC1 and PDK1 inputs to S6K1 are therefore sequential rather than independent.",
