     "mechanism": "Progressive accumulation and aggregation of amyloid-beta is a defining neuropathological feature of Alzheimer's disease and is causally sufficient in the autosomal dominant forms caused by APP and presenilin mutations, although its primacy in sporadic disease remains debated; this aggregate burden is also the target of the autophagy-based rationale for mTOR inhibition.",
